# Keep host build artifacts and platform-specific deps out of the image build
# context. Dependencies are installed fresh inside each Dockerfile's deps stage;
# copying the host node_modules (Windows) over the container's (Alpine/Linux)
# breaks native binaries and pnpm's symlink layout.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local-only / non-build assets
design
docker-compose*.yml
**/*.md
